<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-24T22:36:59.642Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:36:59 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Burkina Faso junta has reinstated the death penalty for terrorism, treason and high crimes, while its army and Russian mercenaries face fresh accusations of civilian killings, including the discovery of 54 bodies in Tagadayat and strikes in three regions. In Nigeria, suspected bandits killed 37 people in a Taraba border community and 10 people in another raid, and militants killed 14 security personnel in an attack on a base. In Niger, two European women were freed after more than a year of captivity in Libya. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZ9IBY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5kTVc1SC1NRGg3LXBSZnhjX1oyY2F2TExBdFRldkVoQS05Y1UxaUVvWnNJNWtocWgzZEVZdDEyekZ6Xy1BVDNpa0ctMmRxMzNwMk5JN2ZqS3kzNFhiMFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPMlJPWXZxMmZPc3hWemdqaHpKTUxZbGwzalVZNUlvbFdKdWh3ckh5QlBQd19mX3ZkRXNPQ3Nod25qbDhHWHJtbDg4S3JCdGJKb3A1Mmh6bXNBdVI1SUFsY2phQ3pQTGdGUmZCSGlSMjQwUWJZSFd0MTFIcWNOeWFsWmc0cGpSeldxRVZETzhYTmJ0WU1BX3dXdFkxdE9RaFRZaGdiUHczOTN5TG12OHB2Vy0zUXhVa3E1ZXo3ejhkc0RPazJBTVJnQmRhOHE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOeTlVblZTa0RsbzV4NmVHR3N5QXd0T0FfemVCQ0puSWtNdmd2N1h5ZnQ0QXp2UTJjMk40UnFtQzZUb0lZTVZvTm1aRWlqMTBGMmFWTWF5RXRnVHF5YXpiTFpzOUZsM3JpUmlqZGk4N1VIOU5RZlJiZ0dFeUJFSEFxS215ZzNYUDFxVnlkT1JxU3lMb3VU?oc=5&quot;&gt;beninwebtv.com